## Golden: omen numérico comparado por variante (`==`).
omen Kind:
    A is 0
    B is 1
    C is 2

weave label with k as Kind into string:
    if k == A or k == B:
        return "ab"
    else if k == C:
        return "c"
    return "?"

weave main into int:
    calling print with calling label with B
    calling print with "\n"
    return 0
